# Frames from the same live capture that have no BVLC: BACnet over 802.3 with
# an LLC header, cut down to the NPDU. One per line; spaces only group the
# bytes. They go through ParseNPDU, not Parse.
#
# Each line ends where the NPDU ends. The capture held 3 more bytes of padding
# after the I-Am-Router-To-Network frame. The source address in the first
# frame is anonymized to aa.bb.cc.dd:47808.

# Who-Is-Router-To-Network for network 16908, from network 7999
0188 1f3f06aabbccddbac0 00 420c
# I-Am-Router-To-Network: 16625
0180 01 40f1
# Who-Is 1660208..1660208 routed from network 16604, MAC 192.168.0.100:47808
0128 ffff00 40dc06c0a80064bac0 fc 1008 0b195530 1b195530
